#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pair Programming V1"
msgstr "结对编程 V1"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pair Programming (Studio)"
msgstr "结对编程（创作室）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> **Phase 1 ✅ shipped**: three-column layout, syntax-highlighted viewer, file tree/search, terminal, dedicated session platform id.\n"
"> Future work: [Issue #37](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/37).\n"
msgstr ""
"> **阶段 1 ✅ 已交付**：三列布局、语法高亮查看器、文件树/搜索、终端、独立 session 平台 id。\n"
"> 后续工作：[Issue #37](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/37)。\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:16
msgid ""
"**Close the loop first**: read and discuss code with the agent in Studio"
msgstr "**先闭环**：在创作室与 Agent 阅读并讨论代码"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:16
msgid ""
"**Read-only first**: v1 focuses on reading; agent analyzes and suggests — no "
"direct edit/save yet"
msgstr "**只读优先**：v1 聚焦阅读；Agent 分析与建议 — 尚不能直接编辑/保存"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:16
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Platform isolation**: pair-programming sessions use a separate platform "
#| "from parlor chat"
msgid ""
"**Platform isolation**: pair-programming sessions use a separate platform "
"from chat chat"
msgstr "**平台隔离**：结对编程 session 与会客厅对话使用独立平台"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:16
msgid ""
"**Local reads**: server reads files from a configured workspace path (set in "
"Chamber)"
msgstr "**本地读取**：服务端从配置的工作区路径读取文件（在卧室中设置）"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "布局"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│  Studio                  [Pair Programming] [Novel] …    │\n"
"├──────────┬────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┤\n"
"│ Search   │                        │  Session list        │\n"
"│ Files    │     Code viewer        │  ┌────────────────┐  │\n"
"│          │   (syntax highlight)   │  │ session-001    │  │\n"
"│ src/     │                        │  │ session-002    │  │\n"
"│   …      │   Read-only selected   │  ├────────────────┤  │\n"
"│          │   file view            │  │  Chat area     │  │\n"
"└──────────┴────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘\n"
"   Left              Center                  Right\n"
"  file tree        code viewer           session + chat\n"
msgstr ""
"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│  Studio                  [Pair Programming] [Novel] …    │\n"
"├──────────┬────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┤\n"
"│ Search   │                        │  Session list        │\n"
"│ Files    │     Code viewer        │  ┌────────────────┐  │\n"
"│          │   (syntax highlight)   │  │ session-001    │  │\n"
"│ src/     │                        │  │ session-002    │  │\n"
"│   …      │   Read-only selected   │  ├────────────────┤  │\n"
"│          │   file view            │  │  Chat area     │  │\n"
"└──────────┴────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘\n"
"   Left              Center                  Right\n"
"  file tree        code viewer           session + chat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column       | Default width | Resizable |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------- | --------- |\n"
"| Left (tree)  | 260px         | 180–400px |\n"
"| Center       | flex          | —         |\n"
"| Right (chat) | 360px         | 280–500px |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 列           | 默认宽度      | 可调整范围 |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------- | ---------- |\n"
"| 左（树）     | 260px         | 180–400px  |\n"
"| 中           | flex          | —          |\n"
"| 右（对话）   | 360px         | 280–500px  |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:48
msgid ""
"Configure `satellites.pair-programming` in `~/.anima/config.yaml` (see "
"[`satellite-guide.md`](../sap/satellite-guide.md))"
msgstr ""
"在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 中配置 `satellites.pair-programming`（见 "
"[`satellite-guide.md`](../sap/satellite-guide.md)）"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:48
msgid "`anima service start`"
msgstr "`anima service start`"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:48
msgid "Open `http://127.0.0.1:4173`"
msgstr "打开 `http://127.0.0.1:4173`"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:48
msgid "Browse/search files on the left; view selection in the center"
msgstr "左侧浏览/搜索文件；中间查看选中项"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:48
msgid "Create or select a session on the right; discuss code with the agent"
msgstr "右侧创建或选择 session；与 Agent 讨论代码"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:48
msgid "Bottom terminal for debug/ops (isolated from chat session)"
msgstr "底部终端用于调试/运维（与对话 session 隔离）"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session Isolation"
msgstr "会话隔离"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:52
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Pair programming uses platform `studio-pair-programming`, separate from "
#| "parlor (`parlor`) and other platform session lists."
msgid ""
"Pair programming uses platform `studio-pair-programming`, separate from chat "
"(`chat`) and other platform session lists."
msgstr ""
"结对编程使用平台 `studio-pair-programming`，与会客厅（`parlor`）及其他平台 "
"session 列表分离。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Current Limitations"
msgstr "当前限制"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:58
msgid "Read-only viewer (highlight.js), not Monaco"
msgstr "只读查看器（highlight.js），非 Monaco"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:58
msgid "Agent cannot directly edit and save files (Phase 2)"
msgstr "Agent 无法直接编辑并保存文件（阶段 2）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:58
msgid "Workspace must be a path readable by the server process"
msgstr "工作区必须是服务端进程可读的路径"

